Design Patterns:
Startegy(HashingProvider) - Composite(Folder Hiereachy) - Memento(Versioning)

AWS S3 Bucket:
**Bucket Versioning**: to keep a history of the assets
**Object Ownership**: To have access to all objects uploaded by anybody
**Asyncronous Uploads**: When uploading files, the backend only handles the signedUrl, while the heavy media files are sent from the front end to the AWS S3 bucket
To ensure that  the back-end stays fast, light and available for high-traffic use
**Versioning Rotation**: Keeping only the last 5 versions of any asset

